      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="book">
        <p class="quiz-question">4. I want to ___ a flight and a hotel for our trip in May.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="book">book</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="pack">pack</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="board">board</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="check in">
        <p class="quiz-question">5. At the airport, first you ___, then you go through security.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="check in">check in</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="board">board</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="take off">take off</button></div>
